    """
    Code representing the demographic classification that a multi-family property caters to. Source value, or Unknown when no apartment record exists.
    """
    apartmentOwnershipType: ApartmentOwnershipType | None = None
    """
    Code representing the kind of ownership of a multi-family property's building with respect to the units themselves. Source value, or Unknown when no apartment record exists.
    """
    apartmentRentType: ApartmentRentType | None = None
    """
    Code for the rent classification of the multifamily property (e.g. market-rate vs Affordable, discounted to meet affordability standards); CoStar tracks distinct rent series and aggregates rents SF-weighted across types. Source value, or Unknown when no apartment record exists.
    """
    affordableRentSubtype: AffordableRentSubtype | None = None
    """
    Code representing a sub-classification of affordable rent types; must be selected when the property's rent type is classified as 'Affordable'. Source value, or Unknown when no apartment record exists.
    """
    affordableUnits: int | None = None
    """
    Number of units offered at 'Affordable' rents. Only applies when the property's apartmentRentType is set to 'Affordable'.
    """
    numBuildings: int | None = None
    """
    Number of buildings in the apartment property. Duplicative column added (per D. Zucker) in anticipation of retiring PropertyApartmentBuilding; originated from PropertyApartmentBuilding.NumBldgs but made nullable.
    """
    totalNumUnits: int | None = None
