    spaceType: SpaceType | None = None
    """
    Type of space available: Relet (direct), New, Sublet, or Assignment. Direct leasing activity = relet + new; Sublet activity = sublet + assignment.
    """
    isExecutiveSuite: bool | None = None
    """
    Whether the available space is an executive suite. Executive suites are rented by a company that may sublet to other parties; due to high turnover, CoStar does not track that subletting and tracks only the primary company renting the space.
    """
    squareFeetMin: float | None = None
    """
    Smallest amount of square footage the owner will lease.
    """
    squareFeetMax: float | None = None
    """
    Square footage the owner/listing agent advertises for the space. The advertised figure may differ from actual square footage, since it can be rounded to the nearest 10, 100, 1000 sf, etc.
    """
    squareFeetMaxContiguous: float | None = None
    """
    List of space IDs that combine to form this contiguous block; the combinable block, not a sum of all building spaces. Sum of the maximum square feet of the spaces in the same contiguous block that have no off-market date, counting every such space in the block (lease-pending included, and including spaces outside this listing). Without a block key it is the space's own maximum square feet, or 0 when that is missing. Off-market spaces in a block are not counted; 0 if the block is not found.
    """
    rateLow: float | None = None
    """
    May blend component rates (e.g. warehouse + office). Distinct from contract or effective/net rent and not comparable across service types. Low end of the space's asking rate; 0 (not null) when no rate is recorded.
    """
    rateHigh: float | None = None
    """
    May blend component rates (e.g. warehouse + office). Distinct from contract or effective/net rent and not comparable across service types. High end of the space's asking rate; 0 (not null) when no rate is recorded.
    """
    rateBasis: RateBasis | None = None
