    dateOnMarket: AwareDatetime | None = None
    """
    Date the space was listed for lease (anchors time-on-market). A tenant may still occupy the space when listed, e.g. when an owner pressures the current tenant to renew or expects them to vacate. If the true availability date is unknown, the researcher may enter the current or an estimated date; the field cannot be NULL.
    """
    dateOffMarket: AwareDatetime | None = None
    """
    Date the space was taken off the market; the last day on the market is exclusive of this value (the space was not on the market on the entered date). Set when a space is renovated, withheld, or used to pressure an existing tenant to renew. Caution: removing a space can drastically affect the SpaceAvailableGroup. NULL while the space is still on the market.
    """
    leaseTermHigh: int | None = None
    """
    Maximum amount of time (in months) the space can be leased. If non-NULL, leaseTermType must be non-NULL (Days, Months, or Years) and leaseTermLow must be non-NULL and <= leaseTermHigh. Mutually exclusive with leaseTermThru and the month-to-month flag.
    """
    leaseTermLow: int | None = None
    """
    Minimum amount of time (in months) the space can be leased. If non-NULL, leaseTermType must be non-NULL (Days, Months, or Years) and leaseTermHigh must be non-NULL and >= leaseTermLow. Mutually exclusive with leaseTermThru and the month-to-month flag.
    """
    leaseTermThru: AwareDatetime | None = None
    """
    Date the space's lease must end. Displayed as MM/YYYY but stored with the day set to the first of the month (chosen for consistency, since month-end varies). If non-NULL, mutually exclusive with leaseTermType, leaseTermLow, leaseTermHigh, and the month-to-month flag.
    """
    leaseTermType: LeaseTermType | None = None
    """
    Measurable time unit for leaseTermLow/leaseTermHigh, or a state when units cannot be quantified. Values: Years, Months, Days, To Be Determined, Negotiable.
    """
    loadBay: CommercialListingSummaryForLeaseLoadBay | None = None
    """
    Loading-bay detail object for the space (dock/drive-in loading characteristics); a core industrial logistics attribute set. Loading details of the space; always present, with Unknown states and null counts when the space has none.
    """
    commonAreaMaintenanceAmount: float | None = None
    """
    Common Area Maintenance (CAM) expense amount charged in addition to base rent; a pass-through operating cost (with taxes and insurance) the tenant bears under net leases. Surface alongside service type when comparing effective rents.
    """
    commonAreaMaintenanceAmountPerYear: float | None = None
    """
    Annualized Common Area Maintenance charge for the space.
    """
    commonAreaMaintenanceState: RecordStateType | None = None
    """
    Indicates whether common area maintenance exists, does not exist, or is unknown for the space.
    """
    propertyTaxAmount: float | None = None
    """
    Property-tax amount attributed to the space.
    """
    propertyTaxAmountPerYear: float | None = None
    """
    Annualized property-tax amount attributed to the space.
    """
    propertyTaxState: RecordStateType | None = None
    """
    For property-tax applicability on the space.
    """
    rentPlus: float | None = None
    """
    Additional rent add-on amount on top of base rent (e.g. taxes/maintenance/insurance, TMI), increasing the tenant's effective cost.
    """
    notes: list[CommercialListingSummaryNotes] | None = None
    """
    Collection of internal/research notes attached to the space record. Notes on the space.
    """
    isInventoryOffMarket: bool | None = None
    """
    Date the space was taken off the market; the last day on the market is exclusive of this value (the space was not on the market on the entered date). Set when a space is renovated, withheld, or used to pressure an existing tenant to renew. Caution: removing a space can drastically affect the SpaceAvailableGroup. NULL while the space is still on the market. Only for non-exclusive (open) mandates: true when the underlying inventory space has an off-market date, false when it has none; null if the inventory space cannot be found. Always null for other mandates.
    """


